#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""finalechat — message the human from your agent, and get answers back.

Single-file command-line client for Finalechat (https://www.finalechat.com).
Python 3.9+, standard library only. It is also the Claude Code hook handler
(`finalechat hook claude-code`) and an MCP server (`finalechat mcp`).

    finalechat login                      # paste an API token from Settings → Agents
    finalechat say "Deployed v2 to staging"
    finalechat status "Running the test suite…"   # live status line, lapses on its own
    finalechat ask "Ship to prod?" -o Yes -o No
    finalechat wait                       # block until the human replies
    finalechat say "Look at this" -f /tmp/screenshot.png
    finalechat fetch <attachment id>      # download a file the human sent
    finalechat install claude-code        # mirror Claude Code sessions to your phone
"""

